# KSI-RPL: Backup and Recovery Planning
# Validates that ExampleOrg backup infrastructure satisfies recovery planning KSIs:
# - Backup vault: KMS encrypted, WORM locked, min 7-day retention
# - Backup plan: daily/weekly/monthly rules, cross-region copy, 2555-day max retention
# - Pre-backup maintenance window: enabled, running daily before backup window
# - Backup prep log group: exists with 365-day retention

META
    esp_id `ksi-rpl-backup-recovery-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `aws`
    criticality `high`

    title `KSI-RPL: Backup and Recovery Planning`
    description `Validates AWS Backup vault lock, backup plan retention rules, cross-region copy, and pre-backup maintenance window satisfy KSI-RPL-ABO, KSI-RPL-ARP, KSI-RPL-TRC, and KSI-RPL-RRO`
    author `example-security`
    tags `aws,backup,recovery,vault,ssm,fedramp,KSI-RPL-ABO,KSI-RPL-ARP,KSI-RPL-TRC,KSI-RPL-RRO`

    control_mapping `KSI:KSI-RPL-ABO,KSI:KSI-RPL-ARP,KSI:KSI-RPL-TRC,KSI:KSI-RPL-RRO`
    control_objective `KSI-RPL-ABO,KSI-RPL-ARP,KSI-RPL-TRC,KSI-RPL-RRO`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `system-admin`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    inherited_from `AWS:us-east-1:backup-infrastructure`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `3`
    recommendation `Ensure backup vault has WORM lock enabled, backup plan has daily/weekly/monthly rules with cross-region copy, and the pre-backup maintenance window is enabled.`

    component_id `comp-aws-backup`

    impl_KSI_RPL_ABO `Backup alignment with recovery objectives is validated by confirming the backup plan has a monthly rule with DeleteAfterDays >= 2555 (max_delete_after_days >= 2555), confirming backups are retained long enough to meet RPO requirements. The backup vault is validated to have active recovery points (number_of_recovery_points >= 1), confirming backups have successfully completed. The vault WORM lock with min_retention_days >= 7 ensures recovery points cannot be prematurely deleted, protecting backup integrity.`

    impl_KSI_RPL_ARP `Recovery plan alignment is validated by confirming the backup plan has three tiers of rules - daily (has_daily_rule = true), weekly (has_weekly_rule = true), and monthly (has_monthly_rule = true) - providing graduated recovery point objectives across different incident scenarios. Cross-region copy is validated (has_cross_region_copy = true), confirming recovery is possible even in a regional failure scenario, satisfying the requirement to align recovery plans with defined recovery objectives.`

    impl_KSI_RPL_TRC `Recovery capability testing readiness is validated by confirming the backup vault has active recovery points (number_of_recovery_points >= 1) demonstrating successful backup execution, and the SSM maintenance window for pre-backup PostgreSQL dumps is enabled (enabled = true) and running daily (schedule contains cron). The vault WORM lock prevents recovery point deletion, ensuring test recovery points remain available.`

    impl_KSI_RPL_RRO `Recovery objectives are validated by confirming the backup plan enforces a max_delete_after_days >= 2555 retention bound, and the vault lock enforces min_retention_days >= 7. The daily backup schedule (has_daily_rule = true) provides an RPO of at most 24 hours for production data. The pre-backup maintenance window runs daily at 02:00 UTC to dump PostgreSQL databases before the 03:00 UTC backup window, ensuring database-consistent recovery points.`

META_END

DEF
    VAR aws_region string `us-east-1`
    VAR vault_name string `example-org-backup-vault`
    VAR plan_name string `example-org-backup-plan`
    VAR backup_prep_window string `example-org-backup-prep`
    VAR backup_prep_log_group string `/example-org/ssm/backup-prep`

    OBJECT primary_vault
        vault_name VAR vault_name
        region VAR aws_region
    OBJECT_END

    OBJECT backup_plan
        plan_name VAR plan_name
        region VAR aws_region
    OBJECT_END

    OBJECT backup_prep_mw
        window_name VAR backup_prep_window
        region VAR aws_region
    OBJECT_END

    OBJECT backup_prep_logs
        log_group_name VAR backup_prep_log_group
        region VAR aws_region
    OBJECT_END

    STATE vault_compliant
        found boolean = true
        locked boolean = true
        min_retention_days int >= 7
        max_retention_days int >= 365
        number_of_recovery_points int >= 1
        encryption_key_arn string starts `arn:aws:kms:`
    STATE_END

    STATE plan_compliant
        found boolean = true
        rule_count int >= 3
        has_daily_rule boolean = true
        has_weekly_rule boolean = true
        has_monthly_rule boolean = true
        has_cross_region_copy boolean = true
        max_delete_after_days int >= 2555
    STATE_END

    STATE backup_prep_window_compliant
        found boolean = true
        enabled boolean = true
        duration int >= 1
        cutoff int = 0
    STATE_END

    STATE backup_prep_logs_compliant
        found boolean = true
        retention_in_days int >= 365
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN aws_backup_vault
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF vault_compliant
            OBJECT_REF primary_vault
        CTN_END

        CTN aws_backup_plan
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF plan_compliant
            OBJECT_REF backup_plan
        CTN_END

        CTN aws_ssm_maintenance_window
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF backup_prep_window_compliant
            OBJECT_REF backup_prep_mw
        CTN_END

        CTN aws_cloudwatch_log_group
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF backup_prep_logs_compliant
            OBJECT_REF backup_prep_logs
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
